1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Open Scrolling. Choose Standard or Smooth first; use Custom only for fine adjustments.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Speed controls distance per wheel step. Higher moves farther. Direction switches reverse the scroll direction.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:25,000
In an app profile, enable its scrolling override to customize only that app. Leave it off to inherit All apps.

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Advanced → Button response: choose Fast, Normal or Relaxed. Fine-tune hold/double-click timing only if needed.

5
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Settings contains language, appearance, login launch and updates. Show action name on screen is optional.

6
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:50,667
About contains developer contact and Buy Me a Coffee. Export/import your settings before moving to another Mac.
